  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "path": "/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888/",
      "title": "Five Pesos, El Banco de Oriente (1888) | Notofilia",
      "description": "Catalog record numismático: banknote de Five Pesos de El Banco de Oriente, Rionegro, Antioquia, 1888, era de la banca libre colombiana.",
      "ogTitle": "El Banco de Oriente — Five Pesos (1888)",
      "ogDescription": "Banknote of Five Pesos de El Banco de Oriente, Rionegro, Antioquia, emitido en 1888. Colección privada Notofilia.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"El Banco de Oriente — 5 Pesos (1888)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/free-banking/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Free Banking catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Free Banking &middot; Rionegro, Antioquia &middot; 1888</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">El Banco de Oriente</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Five Pesos &middot; Series I, N.&deg; 6227 &middot; Rionegro, February 14, 1888</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote of Five Pesos de El Banco de Oriente, obverse arriba con viñeta de paisaje montañoso y firma de Ramón Correa, reverse abajo con guilloché anaranjado y medallones BANCO DE ORIENTE\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"664\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colombia (Sovereign State / Department of Antioquia)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de Oriente, a public limited company with headquarters in Rionegro, Antioquia</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Five pesos, sterling in current currencies</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Type of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bearer and demand banknote, issued by a private bank established as a public limited company during the era of free banking in Antioquia</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series / Number</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Series I, No.&deg; 6227</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Place and Date</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Rionegro, February 14, 1888</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signature</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Ramón Correa, Manager</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rarity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Uncommon: issuance by one of the Antioquian regional banks of the era of free banking, today scarcely represented in collections</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">No Pick number confirmed for this denomination in the sources consulted<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-oriente-5-pesos-1888.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Five Pesos de El Banco de Oriente, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Founded by public deed in Rionegro:</strong>The Banco de Oriente was established in 1883 by public deed executed before the notary of the Rionegro circuit &mdash;, as stated in the legend printed on this banknote &mdash;, as a public limited company with a subscribed capital of close to $126,000 pesos, distributed among more than 220 shareholders from different towns in eastern Antioquia.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The third largest bank in Antioquia:</strong>by subscribed capital, Banco de Oriente ranked as the department's third-largest banking institution, behind only Banco de Medellín and Banco de Antioquia.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup>Its first banknote issue, produced in 1884, totaled 21,000 pesos, followed that same year by three additional issues totaling another 110,000 pesos.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The only Antioquia bank outside the Aburrá Valley:</strong>unlike nearly all Antioquian banking establishments, which were concentrated in Medellín, Banco de Oriente operated from Rionegro &mdash;the former seat of the 1863 Convention and a commercial center that, thanks to the mining boom in the Santa Rosa and Rionegro highlands, had supplied the mines of northern and eastern Antioquia since the eighteenth century.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A regional bank, with regional scope:</strong>its discount and credit operations remained local, serving mainly merchants in eastern Antioquia and the bank's own partners, without extending into the gold trade or foreign commerce handled by Medellín's major banks.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Central vignette:</strong>mountainous landscape of eastern Antioquia, in orange ink, framed by an engraved oval &mdash;a representative view of the region where the bank operated.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Side rosettes:</strong>four geometric medallions with the value &ldquo;5&rdquo; repeated in the corners, typical of nineteenth-century banking guilloché.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Founding legend:</strong>&ldquo;Founded by public deed granted in Rionegro on March 5, 1883&rdquo;, printed vertically along both side margins of the obverse.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Text of the obligation:</strong>&ldquo;The Banco de Oriente will pay to the bearer and on demand Five Pesos of sterling, in current coins&rdquo;, with place and date handwritten &mdash;&ldquo;Rionegro, February 14, 1888&rdquo;&mdash; and the handwritten signature of Ramón Correa as Manager, together with the lines for Cashier and Secretary of the Board of Directors.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Numbering:</strong>&ldquo;Serie I, N.&deg; 6227&rdquo;, printed in the upper corners next to the header &ldquo;BANK OF THE ORIENT&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>Full geometric guilloche in orange ink, with three large medallions &mdash;&ldquo;BANK&rdquo;, &ldquo;5&rdquo; and &ldquo;EAST&rdquo;, flanked by two smaller circles with the value &ldquo;5&rdquo;&mdash; and the text on the obverse visible in transparency.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Additional Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Like most Colombian regional banks, the Banco de Oriente saw its issuance capacity restricted after the 1886 decree that established the forced exchange of the National Bank note, and the 1887 prohibition on issuance by private banks &mdash;measures that the minutes of its own board of directors recorded with marked opposition.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup>The bank continued to operate well into the 20th century, decades before the Bank of the Republic assumed the absolute monopoly of monetary issuance in Colombia in 1923.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">5</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. A ten-peso bill (1887) from the same bank is cataloged in collectors' literature as Pick PS-699; A confirmed catalog number was not found for the denomination of five pesos.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Meisel Roca, Adolfo, and María Teresa Ramírez (eds.). &ldquo;Currency and Banking in a Gold Economy: The Antioquia Region (Colombia), 1850&ndash;1890.&rdquo;<em>Economic Analysis</em>, UAM Azcapotzalco / SciELO Mexico, 2011; and Sánchez, Fabio, et al. &ldquo;Banking and Region in Colombia, 1850&ndash;1880.&rdquo;<em>Economics Notebooks</em>, Universidad Nacional de Colombia, 2009.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">3. Botero Herrera, María Mercedes. &ldquo;Local Banks in the Nineteenth Century: The Case of Banco de Oriente in Antioquia.&rdquo;<em>Cultural and Bibliographic Bulletin</em>, vol. 25, n.&deg; 17, Banco de la República, 1988, pp. 76&ndash;93.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">4. Meisel Roca, Adolfo, and María Teresa Ramírez (eds.),<em>op. cit.</em></p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">5. Banco de la República. &ldquo;Chapter V. Commercial Banks in the Era of Free Banking, 1871&ndash;1923.&rdquo;<em>repositorio.banrep.gov.co</em>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "El Banco de Oriente",
      "eyebrow": "Banca Libre · Rionegro, Antioquia · 1888"
    }
